Here is what appears in the repo (note: the copy uses **「近 7 天代課記錄」** with spaces and **記錄**, not **紀錄**; `DirectorDashboard.vue` only embeds a child component).

---

## 1. `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/DirectorDashboard.vue`

### Template (work column around the PRD comment + card)

The visible “近 7 天代課” UI is a single component; surrounding context is the adjacent sections in the same column.

