### Styles: tablet-oriented breakpoints (900px block is labeled iPad / narrow content; 1100px / 768px also adjust columns)

```4570:4652:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
/* ── Tablet Responsive ── */
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .teacher-col { min-width: 0; }
}

/* ── Tablet (iPad portrait, sidebar-aware ~520-650px content) ── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .week-overview-grid { min-width: 540px; }
  .day-col { min-width: 66px; }
  .day-col-header { height: 50px; padding: 4px; }
  .day-col-name { font-size: 11px; }
  .day-col-date { font-size: 9px; }
  ...
  .teacher-col-header { height: 56px; padding: 6px; gap: 4px; }
  ...
  .teacher-col-name { font-size: 11px; }
  ...
  .teacher-courses { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .teacher-table { min-width: 500px; }
  .time-col { min-width: 40px; width: 40px; }
  ...
}

...

/* ── Mobile Responsive ── */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  ...
  .teacher-col { min-width: 80px; }
  .week-view { overflow-x: auto; }
  .teacher-grid-wrapper { overflow-x: auto; }
  .teacher-grid { min-width: max-content; }
  .teacher-col-header { padding: 6px 6px; gap: 4px; height: 56px; }
  ...
  .teacher-col-name { font-size: 11px; }
  ...
}
```

**Behavior summary:** Day view shows **`teacher.username`** in each column header. Week overview shows **`course.teacher_name`** in a **`.cb-teacher-tag`** inside the cell when more than one teacher is selected. Narrow viewports rely on **`.teacher-grid-wrapper` / `.week-view` horizontal scroll**, smaller header fonts (900px / 768px), and **ellipsis** on `.cb-teacher-tag`.

